<metadata><name>Day 19 - Hilton Falls, Philip Gosling, Restoration</name></metadata>
<wpt lat="43.505705" lon="-79.961589"><name>P Start/finish parking</name><desc>Reservation system in effect. Paid: $12 per adult at gate, $10.50 online (+HST); no separate vehicle fee · book ahead</desc><sym>Parking Area</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.509587" lon="-79.957415"><name>J1</name><desc>J1: Turn left onto the white-blazed main Bruce Trail, heading north-west. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off behind you.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.511568" lon="-79.960424"><name>J2</name><desc>J2: Turn left onto the blue-blazed Hilton Falls Side Trail, heading west. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off on your right.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.509538" lon="-79.978905"><name>J3</name><desc>J3: Turnaround point. Turn around and retrace your steps.</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.522352" lon="-79.956131"><name>J4</name><desc>J4: Turn left onto the blue-blazed Restoration Side Trail, heading north-west. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off ahead.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.523021" lon="-79.957369"><name>J5</name><desc>J5: End of the Restoration Side Trail. Turn around and retrace your steps.</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
